      "title": "Orders — clean baseline (20 rows)",
      "description": "One row per delivery order. Used for formula syntax, aggregation, logical functions, conditional aggregation, lookups, sorting, filtering, tables, named ranges, pivot tables, and chart exercises. delivery_minutes is NULL for Pending/Cancelled rows (non-delivered orders have no recorded time). Note: teaching-block ranges such as D2:D51 span 50 rows; this dataset has 20 rows — learners should adjust range references to D2:D21 in practice.",
